{{Short description|Italian metal band}}
'''Ancient Dome''' is an Italian [[thrash metal]] band. They have released five albums, all through [[Punishment 18 Records]].

==Discography==
*''Human Key'' (2009)<ref>{{cite web|url=https://metalitalia.com/album/ancient-dome-human-key/|title=ANCIENT DOME – Human Key|type=review|last=Giuliani|first=Claudio|date=2 April 2009|work={{ill|Metalitalia.com|it}}|language=it|access-date=30 September 2026}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=https://metal-temple.com/review/ancient-dome-human-key/|title=Human Key Ancient Dome|type=review|last=Dafopoulos|first=Yiannis|date=26 February 2009|work=Metal Temple|access-date=30 September 2026}}</ref> – redone as ''Human Key 2.0'' (2025)
*''Perception of This World'' (2010)<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.metal-hammer.de/reviews/ancient-dome-perception-of-this-world-review/|title=Ancient Dome PERCEPTION OF THIS WORLD Review|type=review|work=[[Metal Hammer Germany]]|date=19 December 2010|language=de|access-date=30 September 2026}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.metal.de/reviews/ancient-dome-perception-of-this-world-39413/|title=Ancient Dome - Perception Of This World|type=review|date=16 November 2010|author=Florian|work=[[Metal.de]]|language=de|access-date=30 September 2026}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=https://metalitalia.com/album/ancient-dome-perception-of-this-world/|title=ANCIENT DOME – Perception Of This World|type=review|last=Giuliani|first=Claudio|work={{ill|Metalitalia.com|it}}|language=it|date=2 December 2010|access-date=30 September 2026}}</ref>
*''Cosmic Gateway to Infinity'' (2014)<ref>{{cite web|url=https://metalitalia.com/album/ancient-dome-cosmic-gateway-to-infinity/|title=ANCIENT DOME – Cosmic Gateway To Infinity|type=review|last=Ottolenghi|first=Lorenzo|date=20 January 2015|work=Metalitalia.com|language=it|access-date=30 September 2026}}</ref>
*''O.W.T. ...and Still We Are'' (2015)<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.rockhard.de/reviews/ancient-dome-o-w-t-and-still-we-are|title=ANCIENT DOME - O.W.T. ... And Still We Are|type=review|date=24 February 2016|work=[[Rock Hard (magazine)|Rock Hard]]|issue=346|language=de|access-date=28 September 2026}}</ref>
